// A good the base game has never heard of.
//
// The twenty goods are an enum in code, which sounds like a hard limit and is not: an enum
// in C# is a number with names for some of its values, and the catalogs keep their own name
// tables. An id this catalog has not seen is a new good, provided it says what it is called
// and what it is worth - without those it is a typo, and refusing typos is most of what a
// catalog is for.
//
// From here it is exactly like the other twenty: a market quote in every country, a place in
// the ledger, something the trade routes carry. What it does not have yet is a way of being
// made - see common/production/new_chain.json beside this file.

{
  "titanium": {
    "name": "Titanium",
    "icon": "◈",
    "base_price": 0.132,
    "essential_weight": 0.28,
    "description": "Airframes, hulls and things that must not be heavy."
  }
}
